WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:45.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:45.400 --> 01:46.480
Move closer together.

3
01:46.560 --> 01:47.680
You're out of the frame.

4
01:56.080 --> 01:57.400
A little closer!

5
02:08.400 --> 02:09.240
Three.

6
02:10.120 --> 02:10.960
Two.

7
02:12.040 --> 02:13.080
One.

8
02:21.360 --> 02:22.240
Let me see it.

9
02:22.840 --> 02:23.680
See what?

10
02:24.400 --> 02:26.320
-The photo. -Five hundred.

11
02:29.360 --> 02:32.080
Four hundred. That's my final offer.

12
02:32.160 --> 02:35.200
Or if you treat me to a meal, I might consider it.

13
02:36.280 --> 02:38.040
Say something, will you?

14
02:39.280 --> 02:41.360
Or you can offer something else!

15
02:43.200 --> 02:44.640
Yanzhou!

16
02:59.360 --> 03:01.800
JI HENG HOSPITAL OF QINGYI CITY

17
03:21.120 --> 03:23.240
Your sister isn't here today.

18
03:24.920 --> 03:26.840
Didn't you tell her you were coming today?

19
03:26.920 --> 03:28.040
No.

20
03:28.960 --> 03:30.280
We haven't been in touch for a while.

21
03:31.400 --> 03:32.240
Did you two fight?

22
03:45.760 --> 03:48.640
You're siblings. It's normal to fight sometimes.

23
03:49.240 --> 03:50.360
My sister…

24
03:51.040 --> 03:52.720
What has she been up to lately?

25
03:52.800 --> 03:55.800
Recently, she took on a new tutoring gig.

26
03:55.880 --> 03:58.640
She seems to get along pretty well with the girl.

27
03:59.240 --> 04:04.000
The girl kept pestering your sister to take her out somewhere.

28
04:04.080 --> 04:05.840
And your sister actually agreed.

29
04:06.440 --> 04:07.720
In the past,

30
04:07.800 --> 04:09.080
how could that ever happen?

31
04:09.160 --> 04:10.440
They're going out?

32
04:10.520 --> 04:12.680
Yes. I think they're going to the beach.

33
04:16.200 --> 04:18.560
Are you jealous that your sister gets to go out?

34
04:23.720 --> 04:24.760
I'm jealous of that girl.

35
04:26.880 --> 04:28.680
You don't need to envy anyone.

36
04:28.760 --> 04:31.880
Open the drawer next to you.

37
04:31.960 --> 04:33.520
There's a piece of paper inside.

38
04:34.120 --> 04:36.280
Your sister left something for you.

39
04:38.160 --> 04:39.160
This?

40
04:47.680 --> 04:49.280
BOOK LIST FOR SCHOOL

41
04:54.680 --> 04:58.520
SIS, HAPPY LUNAR NEW YEAR XIAOMIAN

42
05:05.800 --> 05:09.240
BOOK LIST FOR SCHOOL 1. MUST-BUY, 2. FOR REFERENCE

43
05:14.520 --> 05:16.560
SAVE

44
05:20.000 --> 05:21.800
WANG SIYUN: BEGINNING OF SPRING

45
05:25.000 --> 05:27.080
LIKED BY XU FANGLI, ZHUANG NING, ZHANG QI, LIU LINLIN

46
05:27.160 --> 05:29.040
Where is this?

47
05:29.120 --> 05:31.920
Isn't this your Moments cover photo?

48
05:32.000 --> 05:33.680
Did you go on a trip?

49
05:34.680 --> 05:35.640
I won't like the post.

50
05:37.840 --> 05:38.920
What?

51
05:40.560 --> 05:42.240
After all, I'm not even in the photo.

52
05:51.240 --> 05:52.560
CHEN HUIMEI

53
05:52.640 --> 05:54.400
Oh no.

54
06:03.200 --> 06:05.520
-Hello? -How's it going? Are you having fun?

55
06:07.240 --> 06:09.320
How did you know I went out?

56
06:09.400 --> 06:10.560
Ms. Xiaozheng told me.

57
06:10.640 --> 06:13.640
She said you've been doing great and told me to reward you.

58
06:15.000 --> 06:17.840
And here I was foolishly sending you photos of me studying.

59
06:17.920 --> 06:20.160
I was really happy that you sent me photos, okay?

60
06:20.760 --> 06:23.160
Go ahead and have fun. I won't disturb you.

61
06:24.680 --> 06:26.160
You good? Is everything okay?

62
06:27.800 --> 06:30.520
You told Chen Huimei we were going out?

63
06:32.120 --> 06:34.920
Would I really just do what you suggested and get paid for doing nothing?

64
06:37.760 --> 06:38.600
Thank you.

65
06:39.600 --> 06:40.800
You're thanking me too early.

66
06:43.040 --> 06:43.880
Here.

67
06:49.800 --> 06:50.880
I made a reading list for you.

68
06:51.520 --> 06:54.080
The study materials on the market are a mixed bag.

69
06:54.840 --> 06:56.280
You can use this for reference.

70
06:56.360 --> 06:58.200
We're out having fun. Don't be such a buzzkill.

71
06:59.680 --> 07:04.320
You bought so many reference books just to research this for me?

72
07:05.440 --> 07:07.600
I didn't buy them. I read them at the bookstore.

73
07:07.680 --> 07:10.680
Next year, my younger brother will take the College Entrance Exam too.

74
07:10.760 --> 07:12.520
I'm helping him prep his study materials.

75
07:12.600 --> 07:14.880
While I was at it, I took a look for you too.

76
07:16.920 --> 07:18.880
No wonder there were exam questions in there.

77
07:19.840 --> 07:22.480
Looks like your brother isn't very capable

78
07:22.560 --> 07:24.040
if he needs you to do all this for him.

79
07:24.120 --> 07:25.400
Don't be so hard on yourself.

80
07:26.560 --> 07:28.160
I never asked you to prepare anything.

81
07:35.240 --> 07:39.880
BOOK LIST FOR SCHOOL 1. MUST-BUY, 2. FOR REFERENCE

82
07:57.040 --> 07:59.400
-ENJOYING A FEAST WITH THE FAMILY! -LEARNING NEVER ENDS

83
08:06.560 --> 08:07.760
It's her.

84
08:09.480 --> 08:12.520
Recently, she took on a new tutoring gig.

85
08:12.600 --> 08:15.440
She seems to get along pretty well with the girl.

86
08:31.680 --> 08:34.880
TUTORING CONTRACT RENEWAL AGREEMENT

87
08:35.640 --> 08:36.799
This…

88
08:38.080 --> 08:39.640
Winter break is too short.

89
08:39.720 --> 08:41.480
I feel like I barely learned anything.

90
08:42.400 --> 08:45.320
So I discussed it with Chen Huimei,

91
08:45.400 --> 08:47.440
and we're planning to extend the tutoring sessions.

92
08:49.080 --> 08:50.360
You'd better keep working hard.

93
08:50.440 --> 08:52.280
I'm aiming for the top 30.

94
08:53.160 --> 08:55.000
-In your class? -In my grade!

95
09:01.360 --> 09:02.320
Gao Xing.

96
09:03.080 --> 09:04.000
Thank you.

97
09:07.920 --> 09:10.200
Don't get the wrong idea. It's not that I approve of you.

98
09:11.160 --> 09:13.800
This is just a fair exchange.

99
09:13.880 --> 09:15.360
What's a fair exchange?

100
09:17.360 --> 09:18.520
You know what I mean.

101
09:28.880 --> 09:30.720
Gao Xing renewed her tutoring sessions with me.

102
09:30.800 --> 09:32.280
How about I buy you a drink too?

103
09:53.920 --> 09:56.240
What's in your backpack? It's stuffed!

104
09:57.160 --> 09:58.040
Books.

105
09:58.560 --> 10:01.000
I didn't see you bring many books home over break.

106
10:01.080 --> 10:02.440
Why is your bag so full now?

107
10:07.880 --> 10:11.720
My tutor gave me a reading list. I bought every book on it.

108
10:11.800 --> 10:13.080
What kind of tutor works miracles?

109
10:13.160 --> 10:14.760
-Let me see. -No way.

110
10:14.840 --> 10:16.000
There are only two copies.

111
10:16.080 --> 10:17.800
So technically, I'm the only one who has one.

112
10:23.520 --> 10:25.040
Acting cool again.

113
10:28.160 --> 10:29.680
Did I say that out loud?

114
10:30.440 --> 10:31.600
I'm not deaf.

115
10:35.400 --> 10:36.400
Jiang Mian.

116
10:36.480 --> 10:38.560
I was saying you looked cool. You should be happy.

117
10:46.960 --> 10:48.600
GUO XIAO

118
10:49.800 --> 10:51.800
I transferred the perfume money to your bank account.

119
10:51.880 --> 10:53.120
Check whether it came through.

120
10:57.360 --> 11:00.120
Got it. I just spent all my Lunar New Year money,

121
11:00.200 --> 11:01.520
so this came at the perfect time.

122
11:04.520 --> 11:06.680
WU FA

123
11:08.440 --> 11:11.840
Money's received. Looks like there's always a way after all.

124
11:25.840 --> 11:27.840
They still haven't returned from their trip?

125
11:30.840 --> 11:33.120
They missed their flight, so they rebooked.

126
11:33.200 --> 11:35.360
They probably won't get back until late tonight.

127
12:08.360 --> 12:09.400
Where are you going so late?

128
12:10.680 --> 12:12.480
Fangli just texted me saying

129
12:12.560 --> 12:15.160
she and Linlin got locked out of the dorm building.

130
12:15.240 --> 12:18.320
If they wake up the staff to let them in, they'll be marked as returning late.

131
12:18.400 --> 12:21.680
They will lose points and have to write a statement of apology.

132
12:47.320 --> 12:48.680
What do we do?

133
13:05.520 --> 13:07.400
PLEASE RING THE DOORBELL

134
13:23.680 --> 13:24.600
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

135
13:58.400 --> 13:59.560
Zheng Yu.

136
14:00.280 --> 14:03.360
Ma'am, the clothes I hung on the balcony fell downstairs.

137
14:03.440 --> 14:04.960
Wait, why aren't you asleep?

138
14:05.040 --> 14:07.600
Why are you out on the balcony hanging up clothes at this hour?

139
14:07.680 --> 14:09.040
I forgot to wash them earlier.

140
14:09.120 --> 14:10.960
We have field practice in the mountains tomorrow.

141
14:11.560 --> 14:12.760
And it's my only jacket.

142
14:12.840 --> 14:13.720
Then…

143
14:24.000 --> 14:25.280
Go get it.

144
14:26.680 --> 14:28.200
It's too dark outside.

145
14:28.280 --> 14:29.440
I can barely see anything.

146
14:31.400 --> 14:32.680
Fine, wait a moment.

147
14:39.360 --> 14:40.480
Let's go.

148
15:14.720 --> 15:17.120
None of us brought our keys.

149
15:26.720 --> 15:29.640
The dorm supervisor is making her rounds! Hurry up!

150
15:41.560 --> 15:43.760
Zhuang Ning, why is your collarbone sitting so high?

151
15:46.560 --> 15:48.360
No, no. Don't move.

152
16:02.160 --> 16:04.120
That scared me.

153
16:07.240 --> 16:08.840
Zheng Yu, thank goodness you were there.

154
16:09.720 --> 16:10.880
And Zhuang Ning too.

155
16:11.960 --> 16:12.880
We have Zheng Yu to thank.

156
16:14.960 --> 16:15.880
Thank you.

157
16:22.120 --> 16:24.040
We should get some rest.

158
16:24.120 --> 16:26.560
We'll be heading into the mountains in just a few hours.

159
16:28.240 --> 16:29.240
Right.

160
16:31.600 --> 16:33.480
Get up.

161
16:36.760 --> 16:38.360
Everyone, hurry and get on the bus!

162
16:38.440 --> 16:41.600
Once you're on, check in with your group members

163
16:41.680 --> 16:43.640
to make sure everyone's here.

164
16:43.720 --> 16:45.680
The group list is in the group chat.

165
16:56.360 --> 17:00.120
Where are you sitting, Zheng Yu? Why aren't you moving?

166
17:00.200 --> 17:01.960
Everyone's waiting to get on.

167
17:15.240 --> 17:16.160
Zheng Yu.

168
17:16.240 --> 17:18.880
We were put in the same group and are sharing a room.

169
17:20.280 --> 17:21.400
Can I sit here?

170
17:24.520 --> 17:25.359
It's fine.

171
17:29.520 --> 17:31.240
Zheng Yu, want some coffee?

172
17:31.320 --> 17:33.160
It's okay. Thank you. You drink it.

173
17:33.240 --> 17:36.360
Fangli and Linlin bought them for us.

174
17:36.440 --> 17:37.840
We were up so late last night.

175
17:37.920 --> 17:39.360
This should help you stay awake.

176
17:51.080 --> 17:53.560
WEST S385

177
18:03.520 --> 18:05.240
The coffee isn't working.

178
18:09.600 --> 18:10.680
I want to get some sun.

179
19:01.280 --> 19:02.720
Don't forget to take it.

180
19:03.840 --> 19:05.680
Did you leave the water bottle on the bus?

181
19:06.960 --> 19:07.960
Give me your luggage.

182
19:09.480 --> 19:12.680
Everyone, gather around for a moment. I have a few things to say.

183
19:13.280 --> 19:15.640
Last summer, the training base was under maintenance,

184
19:15.720 --> 19:17.440
so our field practice had to be postponed.

185
19:17.520 --> 19:19.680
This year, we're finally doing it.

186
19:19.760 --> 19:23.520
The most important thing during field practice is to stay safe.

187
19:23.600 --> 19:25.040
Don't leave the group on your own.

188
19:25.120 --> 19:26.800
Take all necessary safety precautions.

189
19:26.880 --> 19:29.360
At the same time, you must complete your assignments

190
19:29.440 --> 19:31.880
and apply what you've learned in the classroom

191
19:31.960 --> 19:33.520
to your practical work.

192
19:33.600 --> 19:36.120
Zhang Qi, hand out these logbooks to everyone.

193
19:37.000 --> 19:41.000
Make sure you take good care of the logbook you receive.

194
19:41.080 --> 19:42.640
You must fill it out every day.

195
19:42.720 --> 19:45.240
We'll inspect them after the training ends.

196
19:45.320 --> 19:48.040
Every activity will be assessed and graded.

197
19:48.120 --> 19:49.800
Has everyone received a logbook?

198
19:49.880 --> 19:51.640
-Yes! -Yes!

199
19:51.720 --> 19:53.600
Now, go to the front desk for your room keys.

200
19:53.680 --> 19:56.240
Drop off your luggage, then get yourselves settled.

201
19:56.320 --> 19:58.120
We'll gather at the entrance at ten o'clock.

202
19:58.200 --> 20:00.280
-We'll head into the mountains then. -Okay!

203
20:00.360 --> 20:01.200
Okay, let's go!

204
20:01.280 --> 20:03.080
-Let's go! -Let's go!

205
20:03.160 --> 20:05.160
-Do you want to stay together? -Let's stay together.

206
20:05.240 --> 20:06.640
Let's stay together.

207
20:11.000 --> 20:12.040
Is your bag heavy?

208
20:12.120 --> 20:14.320
Why don't you put it on my suitcase? It'll be easier for you.

209
20:14.400 --> 20:15.960
It's fine. I can manage.

210
20:16.040 --> 20:17.120
Let's go.

211
20:19.160 --> 20:20.720
-It's fine. -I'll carry it.

212
20:20.800 --> 20:21.720
It's okay.

213
20:23.080 --> 20:24.280
Yanzhou.

214
20:24.360 --> 20:25.800
Should I go over and give a heads-up?

215
20:27.680 --> 20:30.120
Heads-up about what? And to whom?

216
20:30.800 --> 20:32.480
I snore when I sleep.

217
20:32.560 --> 20:34.920
If that bothers you, I'll let the group leader know

218
20:35.000 --> 20:36.240
and switch rooms with someone.

219
20:37.080 --> 20:38.200
I don't mind.

220
20:39.800 --> 20:41.080
Then you're in for a rough night.

221
20:48.560 --> 20:49.840
You don't even belong in this room.

222
20:49.920 --> 20:51.200
Why are you hanging around here?

223
20:52.640 --> 20:55.320
Xie Yudi has our room keycard, and I can't find him.

224
20:59.800 --> 21:01.600
You're pretty close to Xie Yudi.

225
21:01.680 --> 21:04.200
Just between us, does he like Zheng Yu?

226
21:09.480 --> 21:11.000
Why else would he always help her out?

227
21:11.080 --> 21:14.080
He donated for her last time, and just now he was carrying her bag.

228
21:14.160 --> 21:15.360
It's been three years.

229
21:15.440 --> 21:16.440
Everyone in class knows.

230
21:16.520 --> 21:19.320
You, the class monitor, are probably the last one to find out.

231
21:20.000 --> 21:20.880
Tell me more.

232
21:20.960 --> 21:22.960
-Drop it. -Come on, tell me!

233
21:24.760 --> 21:28.080
Hotels these days aren't always safe.

234
21:28.160 --> 21:30.560
Even in places like this, there could be hidden cameras.

235
21:30.640 --> 21:31.880
We should check.

236
21:38.320 --> 21:40.080
I'm staying here for Zhuang Ning.

237
21:40.640 --> 21:42.640
You mightn't know, but we went to high school together.

238
21:42.720 --> 21:45.200
Back then, she was often bullied.

239
21:45.280 --> 21:46.760
Our families are close,

240
21:46.840 --> 21:49.680
so during the New Year break, Uncle Zhuang asked me to look after her.

241
21:51.560 --> 21:53.520
You can ask her if you don't believe me.

242
21:59.560 --> 22:01.720
We really were high school classmates.

243
22:03.640 --> 22:06.040
I ran into Xie Yudi downstairs just now.

244
22:06.120 --> 22:09.000
He said he would keep waiting for you.

245
22:09.080 --> 22:11.600
If you don't see him, he might keep sending people.

246
22:11.680 --> 22:13.960
Then the whole building will know.

247
22:19.440 --> 22:23.480
Xie Yudi. I don't need any more help from you here.

248
22:23.560 --> 22:24.960
You can leave.

249
22:28.440 --> 22:29.680
Okay.

250
22:40.720 --> 22:42.760
Xie Yudi always used to know where I was in the past.

251
22:43.720 --> 22:45.200
You were the one telling him, right?

252
22:46.680 --> 22:47.520
I don't like that.

253
22:56.760 --> 22:58.760
When observing and documenting plants,

254
22:58.840 --> 23:00.760
be sure to record the observation date,

255
23:00.840 --> 23:03.120
including the exact month and day.

256
23:03.200 --> 23:06.160
You also need to record the latitude, longitude, and elevation.

257
23:06.240 --> 23:09.080
From a broad overview to fine details, there are four sections in total.

258
23:09.160 --> 23:11.040
I see many of you brought cameras too.

259
23:11.120 --> 23:13.840
When you photograph the plants later, remember this.

260
23:13.920 --> 23:15.520
Don't just photograph one plant.

261
23:15.600 --> 23:17.120
Photograph the entire cluster.

262
23:17.200 --> 23:19.280
Document the shape of the branches and their color.

263
23:19.360 --> 23:22.280
Next are the leaves. Pay close attention to them.

264
23:22.360 --> 23:23.840
Photograph both sides,

265
23:23.920 --> 23:26.720
and touch the leaves to feel their texture.

266
23:26.800 --> 23:28.360
Be sure to record that too.

267
23:28.440 --> 23:29.920
Finally, the flowers and fruit.

268
23:30.000 --> 23:31.920
That will give you a complete record of the plant.

269
23:33.280 --> 23:34.360
Let me see yours.

270
23:37.520 --> 23:39.200
STORAGE FULL

271
23:42.160 --> 23:43.760
Zheng Yu, use this.

272
23:45.840 --> 23:48.120
It's okay. I'll just clear some space.

273
23:51.000 --> 23:51.880
Take plenty of photos.

274
23:51.960 --> 23:54.360
We can use your photos for the presentation later.

275
23:56.080 --> 23:56.920
Okay.

276
24:01.560 --> 24:02.680
DELETE THESE ITEMS?

277
24:17.840 --> 24:18.920
What's on your mind?

278
24:21.080 --> 24:22.240
Everyone, listen up.

279
24:22.320 --> 24:23.800
There's a pavilion up ahead.

280
24:23.880 --> 24:26.720
We'll go there and take a 30-minute break. Drink some water and grab a bite.

281
24:26.800 --> 24:28.680
Later, we'll form groups to set up sample plots.

282
24:28.760 --> 24:30.160
-Okay. -Okay.

283
24:30.240 --> 24:33.120
-Let's go. -Let's gather.

284
24:57.040 --> 24:58.920
Chen Yanzhou, she's over there.

285
25:29.720 --> 25:30.960
Xie Yudi.

286
26:10.160 --> 26:11.680
This is your hat, right?

287
26:13.720 --> 26:14.960
Why did it end up with me?

288
26:16.680 --> 26:18.680
It got windy earlier, and my hat blew away.

289
26:18.760 --> 26:20.920
It probably blew it right onto your face.

290
26:23.000 --> 26:24.000
You should be happy.

291
26:24.080 --> 26:26.200
It takes sharp features for it to stay put.

292
26:42.960 --> 26:44.320
It's all my fault.

293
26:44.400 --> 26:45.560
I have terrible luck.

294
26:45.640 --> 26:47.960
I drew the highest spot for our sample plot.

295
26:49.120 --> 26:49.960
It's not too bad.

296
26:50.040 --> 26:51.400
The slope isn't very steep.

297
26:56.360 --> 26:58.760
Be careful. Those shoes can slip easily.

298
27:34.560 --> 27:36.520
I used to think you just didn't like to smile.

299
28:08.520 --> 28:10.720
-What is it? -Nothing.

300
28:10.800 --> 28:12.520
I just feel like

301
28:12.600 --> 28:15.280
since winter ended, you've seemed a little different.

302
28:23.680 --> 28:24.800
Back in high school,

303
28:24.880 --> 28:28.560
I used to love putting all kinds of motivational stickers on my laptop too.

304
28:28.640 --> 28:30.840
Were stickers popular back then where you were too?

305
28:30.920 --> 28:33.240
I didn't have a laptop in high school.

306
28:33.320 --> 28:35.200
I bought this for cheap

307
28:35.280 --> 28:38.520
on the Campus Forum when I started university.

308
29:08.720 --> 29:10.520
THIS PLACE HAS TOO MANY MOSQUITOES.

309
29:10.600 --> 29:11.960
GO BUY SOME MOSQUITO REPELLENT.

310
29:20.520 --> 29:22.320
I bought fresh strawberries from the locals.

311
29:22.400 --> 29:23.280
They're washed.

312
29:25.120 --> 29:26.160
I'll get going.

313
29:31.960 --> 29:34.040
Zheng Yu, have some strawberries.

314
29:35.760 --> 29:37.160
I already brushed my teeth.

315
29:40.600 --> 29:42.000
Where are you going so late?

316
29:43.760 --> 29:44.880
I need some fresh air.

317
29:55.480 --> 29:57.200
BOTANICAL INFORMATION

318
30:01.680 --> 30:04.000
Bougainvillea.

319
30:04.080 --> 30:05.600
Black nightshade.

320
30:06.160 --> 30:07.160
And…

321
30:08.200 --> 30:09.440
This is--

322
30:09.520 --> 30:11.480
Hairy maiden fern from the Thelypteridaceae family.

323
30:11.560 --> 30:13.400
It's a perennial herb.

324
30:13.480 --> 30:15.880
No need to count them. We have enough. Let me carry these.

325
30:17.160 --> 30:18.840
It's fine. I've got it.

326
30:18.920 --> 30:22.120
You guys found most of these,

327
30:22.200 --> 30:23.800
so I should help out somehow.

328
30:27.480 --> 30:30.120
Should we find an open area tonight and try light trapping?

329
30:31.520 --> 30:34.160
Isn't it too early in the season for light trapping?

330
30:34.240 --> 30:36.280
Besides, we don't have the equipment.

331
30:36.360 --> 30:37.720
We're already here.

332
30:37.800 --> 30:40.000
If we find anything, we might even earn extra points.

333
30:40.080 --> 30:42.240
As for the equipment, I'll take care of it.

334
30:42.880 --> 30:44.000
What do you think?

335
30:44.760 --> 30:45.880
I… I don't mind.

336
30:54.840 --> 30:56.520
Zhuang Ning, aren't you going to eat?

337
30:57.280 --> 30:58.360
I'm not that hungry.

338
30:58.440 --> 31:00.800
I want to prepare the materials for this afternoon's specimens.

339
31:20.200 --> 31:22.600
There are so many empty seats. You're not cramped here?

340
31:23.560 --> 31:27.240
The teacher said that members of the same group should stick together.

341
31:35.560 --> 31:38.440
I don't remember this being part of your field practice schedule.

342
31:40.320 --> 31:41.200
Are you done eating?

343
31:48.080 --> 31:49.400
Say hello to the boss for me.

344
31:59.840 --> 32:02.560
I remember a guy from last year's class

345
32:02.640 --> 32:05.720
who used light trapping as an excuse to take his girlfriend stargazing.

346
32:05.800 --> 32:08.360
She ended up getting bitten by bugs,

347
32:08.440 --> 32:10.120
and she dumped him when they got back.

348
32:11.200 --> 32:12.880
Remember to bring some ointment.

349
32:17.560 --> 32:18.680
Weren't you done eating?

350
32:22.520 --> 32:23.680
I'm hungry again.

351
32:25.600 --> 32:26.720
So childish.

352
32:42.840 --> 32:46.880
The kitchen staff said they'd never seen a plate scraped so clean.

353
32:46.960 --> 32:48.520
They gave us another plate for free.

354
32:49.720 --> 32:51.960
Weren't you hungry again? Eat some more.

355
34:02.560 --> 34:04.280
I WOKE UP LATE AND DIDN'T GO UP THE MOUNTAIN.

356
34:04.360 --> 34:05.720
GIVE ME SOME OF YOUR SAMPLES.

357
34:38.560 --> 34:40.360
-What's wrong? -Several species are missing.

358
34:45.480 --> 34:48.120
I think this was all I had when I brought them back.

359
34:49.880 --> 34:52.440
Could you have dropped some on the way back to base?

360
34:53.679 --> 34:54.679
That's possible.

361
34:54.760 --> 34:56.199
I wasn't paying much attention.

362
34:57.560 --> 34:58.880
Never mind. This should be enough.

363
34:58.960 --> 35:00.000
Let's finish these first.

364
35:10.280 --> 35:11.680
I'm going to the restroom.

365
35:14.840 --> 35:17.280
Hey, don't mess with me. Go away!

366
35:53.840 --> 35:55.040
Zhuang Ning.

367
35:55.120 --> 35:58.000
It's about time to go light trapping.

368
35:58.080 --> 36:00.640
I… I have a bit of diarrhea.

369
36:00.720 --> 36:02.560
I'd like to stay here and rest.

370
36:03.240 --> 36:04.240
Is it bad?

371
36:04.320 --> 36:06.800
It's fine. It happens all the time.

372
36:06.880 --> 36:10.560
I have a sensitive stomach. I often get diarrhea if I get a bit of a cold.

373
36:10.640 --> 36:12.640
Then get some rest. I'll head out first.

374
36:34.440 --> 36:36.480
THE FOOD IN THIS PLACE IS AWFUL. GO GET ME SOME TAKEOUT.

375
36:36.560 --> 36:38.000
I'LL WAIT FOR YOU IN THE ACTIVITY ROOM.

376
36:40.800 --> 36:42.000
Starting navigation.

377
36:42.080 --> 36:43.200
The total distance is 2 km.

378
36:43.280 --> 36:45.240
You'll arrive at 8:20 p.m.

379
36:45.320 --> 36:46.320
Depart now.

380
36:46.400 --> 36:48.360
Turn right in 214 m.

381
37:02.560 --> 37:05.280
ACADEMIC BUILDING

382
37:11.120 --> 37:12.920
Something came up, so Zhuang Ning can't make it.

383
37:14.440 --> 37:16.000
Where did you get all this stuff?

384
37:17.160 --> 37:19.120
I heard Li Yanan mention before

385
37:19.200 --> 37:21.400
that the base owner is an insect enthusiast,

386
37:21.480 --> 37:22.920
so I borrowed some equipment from him.

387
37:24.680 --> 37:25.800
Let's go.

388
37:54.240 --> 37:55.360
Let's set it up here.

389
38:37.400 --> 38:39.640
Guess how many insect species will land here tonight.

390
38:39.720 --> 38:41.680
It's only early spring.

391
38:41.760 --> 38:44.200
Light trapping is best done in May or June at the earliest.

392
38:46.440 --> 38:47.360
Well, let's see.

393
38:56.480 --> 38:57.560
Indian owlet-moth.

394
38:58.600 --> 39:00.040
Silver-striped hawkmoth.

395
39:00.720 --> 39:01.880
Geometrid moth.

396
39:02.720 --> 39:03.720
Japanese vine hawkmoth.

397
39:04.480 --> 39:05.360
Cotton bollworm.

398
39:07.040 --> 39:08.360
You have great eyesight.

399
39:09.360 --> 39:10.560
So do you.

400
39:12.480 --> 39:15.000
I first learned that insects are attracted to light

401
39:15.080 --> 39:16.920
when I was in my second year of elementary school.

402
39:18.080 --> 39:19.440
Then you're smarter than me.

403
39:21.360 --> 39:22.640
My older brother told me.

404
39:28.800 --> 39:33.920
He said living things instinctively move toward goals they can see clearly.

405
39:35.440 --> 39:37.000
I found him so annoying back then

406
39:37.080 --> 39:38.520
because he was the kind of person

407
39:38.600 --> 39:41.000
who saw goals clearly and could move toward them effortlessly.

408
39:44.520 --> 39:46.840
He was also the one who took me light trapping for the first time.

409
39:47.720 --> 39:50.160
I'd never seen so many nasty bugs in my life.

410
39:54.840 --> 39:56.160
Why did you choose this major?

411
39:58.240 --> 39:59.440
My reason is pretty boring.

412
40:00.000 --> 40:02.760
I won a biology competition when I was in high school,

413
40:02.840 --> 40:04.720
so I got an early admission to Qing Yi University.

414
40:04.800 --> 40:07.800
I considered switching majors to study something more profitable,

415
40:08.400 --> 40:10.120
but this is Qing Yi University's best major,

416
40:10.200 --> 40:12.720
and I could compete for the Vitality Award.

417
40:12.800 --> 40:14.880
After considering it, I decided to stay.

418
40:19.520 --> 40:22.000
Hey, look. There are so many!

419
40:36.080 --> 40:39.080
Let's photograph all these insects and include them in the Field Practice Report.

420
40:40.120 --> 40:42.720
Then could you do the presentation slides this time?

421
40:46.200 --> 40:47.760
Then you take the photos.

422
42:42.960 --> 42:44.560
The food's still hot.

423
42:44.640 --> 42:45.600
I'll get going.

424
42:45.680 --> 42:46.560
What's the rush?

425
42:49.040 --> 42:52.680
Our group agreed to go light trapping together, and I'm already late.

426
42:54.800 --> 42:57.120
Zheng Yu and that repeating student have already left?

427
42:58.680 --> 43:00.320
What's the deal with those two?

428
43:01.320 --> 43:03.200
I… I'm not sure.

429
43:04.760 --> 43:05.800
Why are you nervous?

430
43:10.840 --> 43:12.280
Your roommate is so pretty.

431
43:13.280 --> 43:15.200
It's normal that she has a few guys around her.

432
43:16.640 --> 43:17.760
But

433
43:19.080 --> 43:21.480
it's a bit weird to always hang out

434
43:22.480 --> 43:24.440
with the same person, isn't it?

435
43:27.240 --> 43:28.440
Like the two of us.

436
43:29.800 --> 43:30.840
Do you think

437
43:31.840 --> 43:32.760
that's normal?

438
43:38.840 --> 43:39.840
Hard to answer?

439
43:43.240 --> 43:44.520
Let me ask you something else.

440
43:48.440 --> 43:50.800
Zheng Yu likes Chen Yanzhou.

441
43:52.440 --> 43:53.680
Are they dating?

442
43:56.560 --> 43:57.520
I don't know.

443
44:01.840 --> 44:03.320
Aren't you two roommates?

444
44:04.440 --> 44:05.880
How do you know nothing?

445
44:11.720 --> 44:12.720
Then tell me.

446
44:14.080 --> 44:14.920
What do you know?

447
44:16.880 --> 44:18.000
She doesn't like you.

448
44:43.640 --> 44:45.400
You know I've been pretty nice to you, right?

449
44:47.800 --> 44:50.240
Compared to before, you've definitely toned it down.

450
44:52.720 --> 44:53.720
Of course.

451
44:55.200 --> 44:56.880
We're adults now, after all.

452
45:00.800 --> 45:01.640
Your phone.

453
45:10.680 --> 45:11.520
Let me borrow it.

454
45:12.360 --> 45:13.440
Thanks.

455
45:40.400 --> 45:41.440
Thank you.

456
45:41.520 --> 45:42.680
I found what I lost.

457
46:24.760 --> 46:25.960
I'll return the equipment.

458
46:27.960 --> 46:29.360
In that case, I'll head back to my room.

459
46:46.960 --> 46:48.960
Excuse me. Do you have any antidiarrheal medicine?

460
46:49.040 --> 46:50.640
Something for an upset stomach from a cold.

461
46:51.240 --> 46:52.600
Just a moment. Let me check.

462
47:01.840 --> 47:03.040
Zhuang Ning.

463
47:04.000 --> 47:04.920
Zhuang Ning.

464
47:27.000 --> 47:29.160
NEW MESSAGE

465
47:35.400 --> 47:36.760
There's a campground nearby.

466
47:36.840 --> 47:39.160
I'll wait for you there. There's something I need to tell you.

467
50:11.560 --> 50:16.560
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
